3. What these licences do not grant
-----------------------------------

Neither licence grants any right in:

  - The upstream media feeds described here. Those belong to their operators
    and carry their own terms. See RIGHTS.md.

  - The detection models named here. This repository distributes no model code
    and no weights. Obtain each from its upstream source under its own licence,
    which for some of them is copyleft and for others restricts categories of
    use. See LIMITATIONS.md.

  - The reports published by any deployment of this system. Each carries the
    licence its sources impose, computed per report rather than declared once.

Following this documentation does not clear rights. Clearing rights is per feed
and per use, and it is your job.
